        "id": 214879,
        "name": "The Girl With No Name",
        "username": "The_Girl_With_No_Nam",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-06T09:20:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"X-metal\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/48/4892_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> X-metal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>The Girl With No Name wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I'm partial to the Skoala.&nbsp;I've spent way too long thinking about these, because I have -- I mean, my squirrel roommate has -- sent in several questions about the Animalverse. Let me see... the three best ones I could think of were:&nbsp;- Quackyon- the Chairmanx and the Otterative- Prolebeariat\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nare you squirrel girl?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>No, no, I just happen to live with my animalverse counterpart.&nbsp;</p>",
