      {
        "id": 214881,
        "name": "Escher",
        "username": "Escher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/{size}/4865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-06T13:14:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The Girl With No Name\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n The Girl With No Name:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Quackyon</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the Chairmanx and the Otterative</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Prolebeariat</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh my god Quackyon is too good not to use even if it breaks the 'zootopia' rule.&nbsp; And Prolebeariat?&nbsp; Perfect!&nbsp; Russian bear theme plus a pun!&nbsp; (Okay, is there any way we can get Absolute Zero to be a polar bear?)</p>\n<p>I really liked the Otterative when she was mentioned on the show, though my brother prefers a rabbit-themed Loperative.</p>\n<p>Is it bad that I kind of want Friction to be a sloth?</p>\n<p>Citizen Fawn&nbsp; (or, if we're going with Excatriette, maybe… uh… Catizen Dawn?&nbsp; I dunno.)</p>\n<p>The Matriardvaark</p>\n<p>La Cobayatan/La Cobayadora&nbsp; ('cobaya' means guinea pig in spanish)</p>\n<p>I wanted it to be Grand Warlord Fossa but it's pronounced wrong (\"FOO-sa\").</p>\n<p>That's all I got for now.</p>",
