      {
        "id": 214882,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-06T15:57:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>These are all great ideas, thank you so much for contributing everybody!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think you're being way too limiting! After all, one of the best animalverse puns was the letter addressed to \"Fishtopher and Antam.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I decided on that rule really because the Disney 'animal wearing clothes' style normaly looks best with those kinds of animals. But if a name breaks the rule and is just too good to pass up, then I'll use it.</p>\n<p>Still looking for a good dog-style name for Legacy, if anyone has ideas…</p>",
