      {
        "id": 214887,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-06T20:23:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>AZ doesn't HAVE to be a polar bear. He could always be some other arctic animal,&nbsp;like a rabit or fox. Though thinking about it, PoleHAREriate might be a better idea, what with his powerset and all. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue_winking_eye.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue_winking_eye:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue_winking_eye:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ab-seal-ute Zero would live in the polar regions, but it's not quite the visual I was hoping for.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"starkenburg_alexander\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/48/1857_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> starkenburg_alexander:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b>Phantom5613 wrote:</b></p>\n<div><blockquote>Still looking for a good dog-style name for Legacy, if anyone has ideas...\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nPaul Pawsons?I am actually having trouble too. That's the best I could come up with.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Pawl Pawsons is beautifully Marvel-esque.&nbsp; There's actually a dog breed called the Parson Russell Terrier, but that's too convoluted.&nbsp; Lega-shih-tzu is a stretch and not American enough, but I'd love to see artwork for him.&nbsp; (Lega-shiba-inu would be a more classic look but still not a great pun.)</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
